","en":"Song of Solomon","introKo":"사랑의 아름다움을 노래하는 시입니다.","introEn":"A poem celebrating the beauty of love.","verses":{"ko":[17,17,11,16,16,14,13,14],"en":[17,17,11,16,16,13,13,14]}},{"id":"isaiah","ko":"이사야","en":"Isaiah","introKo":"심판의 경고와 함께, 오실 구원자에 대한 큰 소망을 전하는 예언서입니다.","introEn":"Warnings of judgment and great hope in a coming Savior.","verses":{"ko":[31,22,26,6,30,13,25,22,21,34,16,6,22,32,9,14,14,7,25,6,17,25,18,23,12,21,13,29,24,33,9,20,24,17,10,22,38,22,8,31,29,25,28,28,25,13,15,22,26,11,23,15,12,17,13,12,21,14,21,22,11,12,19,12,25,24],"en":[31,22,26,6,30,13,25,22,21,34,16,6,22,32,9,14,14,7,25,6,17,25,18,23,12,21,13,29,24,33,9,20,24,17,10,22,38,22,8,31,29,25,28,28,25,13,15,22,26,11,23,15,12,17,13,12,21,14,21,22,11,12,19,12,25,24]}},{"id":"jeremiah","ko":"예레미야","en":"Jeremiah","introKo":"무너져 가는 나라를 향해 눈물로 하나님의 말씀을 전한 선지자의 기록입니다.","introEn":"A prophet who wept as he spoke God's word to a falling nation.","verses":{"ko":[19,37,25,31,31,30,34,22,26,25,23,17,27,22,21,21,27,23,15,18,14,30,40,10,38,24,22,17,32,24,40,44,26,22,19,32,21,28,18,16,18,22,13,30,5,28,7,47,39,46,64,34],"en":[19,37,25,31,31,30,34,22,26,25,23,17,27,22,21,21,27,23,15,18,14,30,40,10,38,24,22,17,32,24,40,44,26,22,19,32,21,28,18,16,18,22,13,30,5,28,7,47,39,46,64,34]}},{"id":"lamentations","ko":"예레미야애가","en":"Lamentations","introKo":"예루살렘의 멸망을 슬퍼하며 하나님의 자비를 붙드는 노래입니다.","introEn":"Songs of grief over Jerusalem that still cling to God's mercy.","verses":{"ko":[22,22,66,22,22],"en":[22,22,66,22,22]}},{"id":"ezekiel","ko":"에스겔","en":"Ezekiel","introKo":"포로로 끌려간 땅에서 본 환상과 회복의 약속을 담은 예언서입니다.","introEn":"Visions and promises of restoration, given in exile.","verses":{"ko":[28,10,27,17,17,14,27,18,11,22,25,28,23,23,8,63,24,32,14,49,32,31,49,27,17,21,36,26,21,26,18,32,33,31,15,38,28,23,29,49,26,20,27,31,25,24,23,35],"en":[28,10,27,17,17,14,27,18,11,22,25,28,23,23,8,63,24,32,14,49,32,31,49,27,17,21,36,26,21,26,18,32,33,31,15,38,28,23,29,49,26,20,27,31,25,24,23,35]}},{"id":"daniel","ko":"다니엘","en":"Daniel","introKo":"낯선 땅 바벨론에서 믿음을 지킨 다니엘과 친구들의 이야기입니다.","introEn":"Daniel and his friends stay faithful in a foreign land.","verses":{"ko":[21,49,30,37,31,28,28,27,27,21,45,13],"en":[21,49,30,37,31,28,28,27,27,21,45,13]}},{"id":"hosea","ko":"호세아","en":"Hosea","introKo":"떠나간 백성을 끝까지 사랑하시는 하나님의 마음을 보여 줍니다.","introEn":"God's relentless love for a people who walked away.","verses":{"ko":[11,23,5,19,15,11,16,14,17,15,12,14,16,9],"en":[11,23,5,19,15,11,16,14,17,15,12,14,16,9]}},{"id":"joel","ko":"요엘","en":"Joel","introKo":"재앙 가운데 돌아오라는 부르심과 성령을 부어 주시겠다는 약속입니다.","introEn":"A call to return, and a promise that God will pour out his Spirit.","verses":{"ko":[20,32,21],"en":[20,32,21]}},{"id":"amos","ko":"아모스","en":"Amos","introKo":"정의를 강물처럼 흐르게 하라고 외친 목자 출신 선지자의 말씀입니다.","introEn":"A shepherd-prophet calls for justice to roll like a river.","verses":{"ko":[15,16,15,13,27,14,17,14,15],"en":[15,16,15,13,27,14,17,14,15]}},{"id":"obadiah","ko":"오바댜","en":"Obadiah","introKo":"교만한 에돔을 향한 짧은 경고의 말씀입니다.","introEn":"A brief warning against the pride of Edom.","verses":{"ko":[21],"en":[21]}},{"id":"jonah","ko":"요나","en":"Jonah","introKo":"도망친 선지자와 큰 물고기, 그리고 모든 사람을 향한 하나님의 자비 이야기입니다.","introEn":"A runaway prophet, a great fish, and God's mercy for everyone.","verses":{"ko":[17,10,10,11],"en":[17,10,10,11]}},{"id":"micah","ko":"미가","en":"Micah","introKo":"정의를 행하고 겸손히 하나님과 함께 걸으라는 부르심입니다.","introEn":"A call to do justice, love mercy, and walk humbly with God.","verses":{"ko":[16,13,12,13,15,16,20],"en":[16,13,12,13,15,16,20]}},{"id":"nahum","ko":"나훔","en":"Nahum","introKo":"악한 제국 니느웨의 멸망을 선포하는 말씀입니다.","introEn":"The downfall of the cruel empire of Nineveh.","verses":{"ko":[15,13,19],"en":[15,13,19]}},{"id":"habakkuk","ko":"하박국","en":"Habakkuk","introKo":"\"왜 그렇습니까\" 하고 하나님께 묻다가 믿음에 이르는 선지자의 대화입니다.","introEn":"A prophet asks God \"why?\" and arrives at trust.","verses":{"ko":[17,20,19],"en":[17,20,19]}},{"id":"zephaniah","ko":"스바냐","en":"Zephaniah","introKo":"심판의 날에 대한 경고와, 기뻐 노래하시는 하나님의 약속입니다.","introEn":"A warning of judgment, and a God who sings over his people.","verses":{"ko":[18,15,20],"en":[18,15,20]}},{"id":"haggai","ko":"학개","en":"Haggai","introKo":"성전 재건을 미루던 백성에게 다시 시작하라고 격려하는 말씀입니다.","introEn":"Encouragement to stop delaying and rebuild God's house.","verses":{"ko":[15,23],"en":[15,23]}},{"id":"zechariah","ko":"스가랴","en":"Zechariah","introKo":"돌아온 백성에게 주신 환상과, 오실 왕에 대한 약속입니다.","introEn":"Visions for the returned exiles and promises of a coming king.","verses":{"ko":[21,13,10,14,11,15,14,23,17,12,17,14,9,21],"en":[21,13,10,14,11,15,14,23,17,12,17,14,9,21]}},{"id":"malachi","ko":"말라기","en":"Malachi","introKo":"식어 버린 마음을 깨우는 구약의 마지막 말씀입니다.","introEn":"The last word of the Old Testament, waking up cold hearts.","verses":{"ko":[14,17,18,6],"en":[14,17,18,6]}},{"id":"matthew","ko":"마태복음","en":"Matthew","introKo":"구약의 약속을 이루러 오신 왕, 예수님의 삶과 가르침을 전합니다.","introEn":"Jesus the promised King - his life and his teaching.","verses":{"ko":[25,23,17,25,48,34,29,34,38,42,30,50,58,36,39,28,27,35,30,34,46,46,39,51,46,75,66,20],"en":[25,23,17,25,48,34,29,34,38,42,30,50,58,36,39,28,27,35,30,34,46,46,39,51,46,75,66,20]}},{"id":"mark","ko":"마가복음","en":"Mark","introKo":"가장 짧고 빠르게 읽히는 복음서로, 예수님이 누구신지 처음 만나기에 좋습니다.","introEn":"The shortest, fastest-moving Gospel - a great first look at who Jesus is.","verses":{"ko":[45,28,35,41,43,56,37,38,50,52,33,44,37,72,47,20],"en":[45,28,35,41,43,56,37,38,50,52,33,44,37,72,47,20]}},{"id":"luke","ko":"누가복음","en":"Luke","introKo":"소외된 사람들을 찾아가신 예수님의 이야기를 차근차근 기록한 복음서입니다.","introEn":"A careful account of Jesus, who came looking for the lost and overlooked.","verses":{"ko":[80,52,38,44,39,49,50,56,62,42,54,59,35,35,32,31,37,43,48,47,38,71,56,53],"en":[80,52,38,44,39,49,50,56,62,42,54,59,35,35,32,31,37,43,48,47,38,71,56,53]}},{"id":"john","ko":"요한복음","en":"John","introKo":"예수님이 누구신지, 그분을 믿는다는 것이 무엇인지 깊이 보여 주는 복음서입니다.","introEn":"A deep look at who Jesus is and what it means to believe in him.","verses":{"ko":[51,25,36,54,47,71,53,59,41,42,57,50,38,31,27,33,26,40,42,31,25],"en":[51,25,36,54,47,71,53,59,41,42,57,50,38,31,27,33,26,40,42,31,25]}},{"id":"acts","ko":"사도행전","en":"Acts","introKo":"성령이 오신 뒤 교회가 태어나 온 세상으로 퍼져 나가는 이야기입니다.","introEn":"The Spirit comes, the church is born, and the good news spreads.","verses":{"ko":[26,47,26,37,42,15,60,40,43,48,30,25,52,28,41,40,34,28,41,38,40,30,35,27,27,32,44,31],"en":[26,47,26,37,42,15,60,40,43,48,30,25,52,28,41,40,34,28,41,38,40,30,35,27,27,32,44,31]}},{"id":"romans","ko":"로마서","en":"Romans","introKo":"복음이 무엇인지 가장 체계적으로 설명해 주는 바울의 편지입니다.","introEn":"Paul's fullest explanation of what the gospel is.","verses":{"ko":[32,29,31,25,21,23,25,39,33,21,36,21,14,23,33,27],"en":[32,29,31,25,21,23,25,39,33,21,36,21,14,23,33,27]}},{"id":"1corinthians","ko":"고린도전서","en":"1 Corinthians","introKo":"문제 많던 교회에게 사랑으로 하나 되라고 권면하는 편지입니다.","introEn":"A letter to a messy church, calling it to unity and love.","verses":{"ko":[31,16,23,21,13,20,40,13,27,33,34,31,13,40,58,24],"en":[31,16,23,21,13,20,40,13,27,33,34,31,13,40,58,24]}},{"id":"2corinthians","ko":"고린도후서","en":"2 Corinthians","introKo":"약함 속에서 드러나는 하나님의 능력을 고백하는 바울의 진솔한 편지입니다.","introEn":"Paul's most personal letter - God's power shown in weakness.","verses":{"ko":[24,17,18,18,21,18,16,24,15,18,33,21,13],"en":[24,17,18,18,21,18,16,24,15,18,33,21,14]}},{"id":"galatians","ko":"갈라디아서","en":"Galatians","introKo":"우리는 행위가 아니라 믿음으로 자유를 얻는다고 선포하는 편지입니다.","introEn":"We are set free by faith, not by keeping rules.","verses":{"ko":[24,21,29,31,26,18],"en":[24,21,29,31,26,18]}},{"id":"ephesians","ko":"에베소서","en":"Ephesians","introKo":"그리스도 안에서 받은 은혜와 새로운 삶을 설명하는 편지입니다.","introEn":"The grace we have in Christ and the new life that follows.","verses":{"ko":[23,22,21,32,33,24],"en":[23,22,21,32,33,24]}},{"id":"philippians","ko":"빌립보서","en":"Philippians","introKo":"감옥에서 쓴, 기쁨이 가득한 짧은 편지입니다.","introEn":"A short letter full of joy, written from prison.","verses":{"ko":[30,30,21,23],"en":[30,30,21,23]}},{"id":"colossians","ko":"골로새서","en":"Colossians","introKo":"모든 것 위에 계신 예수님을 바라보게 하는 편지입니다.","introEn":"A letter that lifts our eyes to Jesus, who is over all things.","verses":{"ko":[29,23,25,18],"en":[29,23,25,18]}},{"id":"1thessalonians","ko":"데살로니가전서","en":"1 Thessalonians","introKo":"어린 교회를 격려하며 예수님의 다시 오심을 소망하게 하는 편지입니다.","introEn":"Encouragement for a young church, and hope in Jesus' return.","verses":{"ko":[10,20,13,18,28],"en":[10,20,13,18,28]}},{"id":"2thessalonians","ko":"데살로니가후서","en":"2 Thessalonians","introKo":"흔들리지 말고 성실히 살며 기다리라고 권면하는 편지입니다.","introEn":"Stand firm, keep working, and wait well.","verses":{"ko":[12,17,18],"en":[12,17,18]}},{"id":"1timothy","ko":"디모데전서","en":"1 Timothy","introKo":"젊은 지도자 디모데에게 교회를 돌보는 법을 가르치는 편지입니다.","introEn":"Advice to a young leader on caring for the church.","verses":{"ko":[20,15,16,16,25,21],"en":[20,15,16,16,25,21]}},{"id":"2timothy","ko":"디모데후서","en":"2 Timothy","introKo":"바울이 생의 끝에서 디모데에게 남긴 마지막 당부입니다.","introEn":"Paul's final words to Timothy near the end of his life.","verses":{"ko":[18,26,17,22],"en":[18,26,17,22]}},{"id":"titus","ko":"디도서","en":"Titus","introKo":"은혜를 받은 사람은 선한 삶으로 나타난다고 가르치는 짧은 편지입니다.","introEn":"A short letter on how grace shows up as a good life.","verses":{"ko":[16,15,15],"en":[16,15,15]}},{"id":"philemon","ko":"빌레몬서","en":"Philemon","introKo":"도망친 종을 형제로 받아 달라고 부탁하는 아주 짧은 편지입니다.","introEn":"A very short plea to welcome a runaway servant as a brother.","verses":{"ko":[25],"en":[25]}},{"id":"hebrews","ko":"히브리서","en":"Hebrews","introKo":"예수님이 구약의 모든 것보다 뛰어나신 분임을 보여 주는 편지입니다.","introEn":"Jesus is greater than everything that came before him.","verses":{"ko":[14,18,19,16,14,20,28,13,28,39,40,29,25],"en":[14,18,19,16,14,20,28,13,28,39,40,29,25]}},{"id":"james","ko":"야고보서","en":"James","introKo":"믿음은 행동으로 드러난다고 말하는, 아주 실제적인 편지입니다.","introEn":"A very practical letter - real faith shows up in what we do.","verses":{"ko":[27,26,18,17,20],"en":[27,26,18,17,20]}},{"id":"1peter","ko":"베드로전서","en":"1 Peter","introKo":"어려움을 겪는 성도들에게 산 소망을 붙들라고 격려하는 편지입니다.","introEn":"Living hope for believers going through hard times.","verses":{"ko":[25,25,22,19,14],"en":[25,25,22,19,14]}},{"id":"2peter","ko":"베드로후서","en":"2 Peter","introKo":"거짓 가르침을 조심하고 믿음 안에서 자라가라는 당부입니다.","introEn":"Watch out for false teaching and keep growing.","verses":{"ko":[21,22,18],"en":[21,22,18]}},{"id":"1john","ko":"요한일서","en":"1 John","introKo":"하나님은 사랑이시며, 우리도 서로 사랑해야 한다고 말하는 편지입니다.","introEn":"God is love, and so we love one another.","verses":{"ko":[10,29,24,21,21],"en":[10,29,24,21,21]}},{"id":"2john","ko":"요한이서","en":"2 John","introKo":"진리와 사랑 안에서 걸어가라는 짧은 편지입니다.","introEn":"A short note about walking in truth and love.","verses":{"ko":[13],"en":[13]}},{"id":"3john","ko":"요한삼서","en":"3 John","introKo":"진리를 위해 수고하는 이들을 잘 대접하라는 짧은 편지입니다.","introEn":"A short note about welcoming those who serve the truth.","verses":{"ko":[15],"en":[14]}},{"id":"jude","ko":"유다서","en":"Jude","introKo":"믿음을 지키기 위해 힘써 싸우라고 권면하는 짧은 편지입니다.","introEn":"A short call to hold on to the faith.","verses":{"ko":[25],"en":[25]}},{"id":"revelation","ko":"요한계시록","en":"Revelation","introKo":"마지막에 하나님이 모든 것을 새롭게 하신다는 소망의 환상입니다.","introEn":"A vision of hope - in the end, God makes all things new.","verses":{"ko":[20,29,22,11,14,17,17,13,21,11,19,17,18,20,8,21,18,24,21,15,27,21],"en":[20,29,22,11,14,17,17,13,21,11,19,17,18,20,8,21,18,24,21,15,27,21]}}],"stages":[{"ko":"예수님을 만나요","en":"Meet Jesus","descKo":"성경의 중심이신 예수님부터 만납니다. 가장 짧은 복음서로 시작해요.","descEn":"Start with the center of the Bible - Jesus - in the shortest Gospel.","start":0,"count":30},{"ko":"모든 것의 시작","en":"In the Beginning","descKo":"세상과 사람, 그리고 하나님의 약속이 시작된 이야기로 돌아갑니다.","descEn":"Go back to where the world, people, and God's promises began.","start":30,"count":72},{"ko":"사랑의 복음","en":"The Gospel of Love","descKo":"예수님이 누구신지 더 깊이 들여다봅니다.","descEn":"A deeper look at who Jesus is.","start":102,"count":40},{"ko":"기도와 지혜","en":"Prayer and Wisdom","descKo":"기도하는 법과 지혜롭게 사는 법을 배웁니다.","descEn":"Learn how to pray and how to live wisely.","start":142,"count":57},{"ko":"자유를 향하여","en":"Set Free","descKo":"하나님이 자기 백성을 노예 생활에서 구해 내십니다.","descEn":"God rescues his people from slavery.","start":199,"count":57},{"ko":"교회의 탄생","en":"The Church Is Born","descKo":"예수님의 제자들이 온 세상으로 나아갑니다.","descEn":"Jesus' followers carry the good news to the world.","start":256,"count":45},{"ko":"기쁨의 편지들","en":"Letters of Joy","descKo":"처음 교회들에게 보낸 짧고 따뜻한 편지들을 읽습니다.","descEn":"Short, warm letters written to the first churches.","start":301,"count":29},{"ko":"약속의 땅","en":"The Promised Land","descKo":"이스라엘이 약속의 땅에 들어가 살아가는 이야기입니다.","descEn":"Israel enters the land and learns to live in it.","start":330,"count":74},{"ko":"예수님의 발자취","en":"In His Steps","descKo":"누가가 차근차근 기록한 예수님의 생애를 따라갑니다.","descEn":"Follow the life of Jesus in Luke's careful account.","start":404,"count":47},{"ko":"왕들의 이야기","en":"The Story of the Kings","descKo":"다윗과 솔로몬, 그리고 그 뒤를 이은 왕들의 시대입니다.","descEn":"David, Solomon, and the kings who followed them.","start":451,"count":193},{"ko":"복음의 깊이","en":"The Depth of the Gospel","descKo":"복음이 무엇이며 어떻게 살아야 하는지 깊이 배웁니다.","descEn":"What the gospel is, and how it changes the way we live.","start":644,"count":56},{"ko":"광야의 학교","en":"School of the Wilderness","descKo":"광야에서 하나님의 백성으로 빚어지는 시간입니다.","descEn":"In the wilderness, God shapes a people of his own.","start":700,"count":150},{"ko":"약속의 성취","en":"Promises Fulfilled","descKo":"구약의 약속이 예수님 안에서 어떻게 이루어졌는지 봅니다.","descEn":"See how the old promises come true in Jesus.","start":850,"count":60},{"ko":"삶의 질문들","en":"Life's Big Questions","descKo":"고난과 인생의 의미, 사랑에 대해 솔직하게 묻습니다.","descEn":"Honest questions about suffering, meaning, and love.","start":910,"count":79},{"ko":"포로와 귀환","en":"Exile and Return","descKo":"나라를 잃고 다시 돌아오기까지, 신실하신 하나님을 봅니다.","descEn":"Through loss and homecoming, God stays faithful.","start":989,"count":157},{"ko":"믿음을 지키라","en":"Keep the Faith","descKo":"다음 세대에게 믿음을 전하는 편지들입니다.","descEn":"Letters that hand the faith on to the next generation.","start":1146,"count":28},{"ko":"선지자들의 외침","en":"Voices of the Prophets","descKo":"심판과 소망을 함께 전한 큰 선지자들의 말씀입니다.","descEn":"The major prophets speak of judgment and of hope.","start":1174,"count":241},{"ko":"끝까지 사랑하시는 하나님","en":"Love That Will Not Let Go","descKo":"열두 선지자의 짧은 말씀과 찬양의 시편을 읽습니다.","descEn":"The twelve short prophets, and psalms of praise.","start":1415,"count":78},{"ko":"새 하늘과 새 땅","en":"All Things New","descKo":"성경의 마지막 책, 모든 것이 새로워지는 소망으로 여정을 마칩니다.","descEn":"The journey ends with the hope of everything made new.","start":1493,"count":23}],"days":[[40,1,1,1,20],[40,1,21,1,0],[40,2,1,2,0],[40,3,1,3,0],[40,4,1,4,20],[40,4,21,4,0],[40,5,1,5,20],[40,5,21,5,0],[40,6,1,6,29],[40,6,30,6,0],[40,7,1,7,23],[40,7,24,7,0],[40,8,1,8,21],[40,8,22,8,0],[40,9,1,9,24],[40,9,25,9,0],[40,10,1,10,31],[40,10,32,10,0],[40,11,1,11,14],[40,11,15,11,0],[40,12,1,12,27],[40,12,28,12,0],[40,13,1,13,13],[40,13,14,13,0],[40,14,1,14,26],[40,14,27,14,52],[40,14,53,14,0],[40,15,1,15,20],[40,15,21,15,0],[40,16,1,16,0],[0,1,1,1,0],[0,2,1,2,0],[0,3,1,3,0],[0,4,1,4,0],[0,5,1,5,0],[0,6,1,6,0],[0,7,1,7,0],[0,8,1,8,0],[0,9,1,9,0],[0,10,1,10,0],[0,11,1,11,0],[0,12,1,12,0],[0,13,1,13,0],[0,14,1,14,0],[0,15,1,15,0],[0,16,1,16,0],[0,17,1,17,0],[0,18,1,18,15],[0,18,16,18,0],[0,19,1,19,17],[0,19,18,19,0],[0,20,1,20,0],[0,21,1,21,21],[0,21,22,21,0],[0,22,1,22,0],[0,23,1,23,0],[0,24,1,24,21],[0,24,22,24,44],[0,24,45,24,0],[0,25,1,25,0],[0,26,1,26,11],[0,26,12,26,0],[0,27,1,27,29],[0,27,30,27,0],[0,28,1,28,0],[0,29,1,29,13],[0,29,14,29,0],[0,30,1,30,24],[0,30,25,30,0],[0,31,1,31,21],[0,31,22,31,42],[0,31,43,31,0],[0,32,1,32,16],[0,32,17,32,0],[0,33,1,33,0],[0,34,1,34,12],[0,34,13,34,0],[0,35,1,35,0],[0,36,1,36,19],[0,36,20,36,0],[0,37,1,37,17],[0,37,18,37,0],[0,38,1,38,16],[0,38,17,38,0],[0,39,1,39,0],[0,40,1,40,0],[0,41,1,41,31],[0,41,32,41,0],[0,42,1,42,24],[0,42,25,42,0],[0,43,1,43,15],[0,43,16,43,0],[0,44,1,44,17],[0,44,18,44,0],[0,45,1,45,0],[0,46,1,46,0],[0,47,1,47,17],[0,47,18,4